    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a wild, unpredictable world of a dog, where nothing makes sense, and every corner brings ridiculous and dangerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scramble through 93 crazy levels, fetching, rescuing, and outsmarting enemies at every turn and doing whatever it takes just to please the owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive mazes packed with wacky enemies, from homeless bums and clowns to club-wielding seals, rampaging gorillas, and Mechasaurus Rex, all while dodging oncoming traffic and relying on a less-than-practical defense to avoid disaster at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as enemies cause mayhem and even taking each other down, as you race to complete your mission across a variety of chaotic environments.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a wild, unpredictable world of a dog, where nothing makes sense, and every corner brings ridiculous and dangerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scramble through 93 crazy levels, fetching, rescuing, and outsmarting enemies at every turn and doing whatever it takes just to please the owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive mazes packed with wacky enemies, from homeless bums and clowns to club-wielding seals, rampaging gorillas, and Mechasaurus Rex, all while dodging oncoming traffic and relying on a less-than-practical defense to avoid disaster at every turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch as enemies cause mayhem and even taking each other down, as you race to complete your mission across a variety of chaotic environments.</p>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a goofy, chaotic adventure as a dog, dodging wacky enemies through a maze of mayhem, all while carrying out your owner's wishes.",
